<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Earthquake</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 90)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast earthquake</a>
</pre>
<p>The druid kneels, hammers both fists on the ground and shouts 'Terra 
Trembler!', and the earth shakes. Everyone in the room is struck, except 
the druid, the druid's leader and everyone who follows that leader; other 
players only when both you and they have signed the Book of Blood. The 
tremor does about the same harm whatever armour one wears, and a shield is 
no use against it; those it hits hard are knocked off their feet, and must 
get up again before they can fight on.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight with everyone it hits. It can be 
cast while fighting, and no free hands are needed. It is also found on 
wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quicksand</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>